The '''Angels''' are [[mini-boss]]es that can appear most commonly in {{R|Angel Room}}s. There are two angel variants: '''Uriel''' and '''Gabriel'''.

== Locations ==
* A random angel appears when destroying an angel statue in an {{R|Angel Room}} with an explosion or similar effects.
* Dark "fallen" versions of both angels show up during the battle against {{E|Mega Satan}}.
** Fallen Uriel has 450 health instead of 400.
** Fallen Gabriel has 750 health instead of 660.
* {{dlc|a}} Uriel appears after the 9th sacrifice and Gabriel appears after the 11th sacrifice in a {{R|Sacrifice Room}}.
* {{dlc|a}} Both angels have a chance of appearing in {{R|Boss Rush}}, though it does not drop a Key Piece on death.
* {{dlc|a+}} Angel Statues can sometimes appear in {{R|Super Secret Room}}s, and {{R|I AM ERROR}} rooms, and in a rare {{s|Cathedral}} [[closet]].
** An angel defeated in a Super Secret Room will award a key piece, but ones defeated in an I AM ERROR room or a closet will not.
* {{dlc|a+nr}} There's a small chance for an angel statue to replace the {{E|Satan}} statue in the {{R|Devil Room}}.

